From 71debf008b69f2dcf51b37feea90474a17bed1ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Kuraev <naoru.desu@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:52:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: package the external DSC
 experiment

Add kernel patch 0130 on top of the complete DisplayPort stack and advance to release 88. The prototype retains the known lower-resolution and compressed-to-uncompressed transition failures documented in the port.
